[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0000","text":"男性搞笑艺人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0010","text":"“请跟我交往────！”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0002","text":"女性艺人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0020","text":"“对不起！！！！！”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0003","text":"男性搞笑艺人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0030","text":"“太快了吧！\n　至少让我把话说完啊！” "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0040","text":"最近这种段子\n很流行吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0050","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0060","text":"其实啊，偶尔也会接到这种邀约\n就是让我去告白，然后对方用狠话单方面拒绝我"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0070","text":"目前\n全部推掉了就是了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0080","text":"今后也请继续保持这样\n拜托了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0090","text":"噢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_01_0100","text":"交给我吧"}]
